/// By default, the [mainAxis] is [Axis.vertical].À&>	À&E␀␀À&NÀ&T␀␀À&rÀ&x␀␀À&À&”␀␀À&^À&bÀ&cÀ&À&©AÀ&â*/// The direction to use as the main axis.␀À&ñ‚<À)&‚/// Whether the list body positions children in the reading direction.
///
/// For example, if the reading direction is left-to-right and
/// [mainAxis] is [Axis.horizontal], then the list body positions children
