///   * [RenderObject.dispose], which instructs a render object to release
///     any resources it may be holding.␀␀ÀÌÕMÀÌì␀␀ÀÌÿÀÍ␀␀ÀÌÕÀÌÖÀÍ(oÀÍ:␀␀ÀÍMÀÍ[␀␀ÀÍcÀÍn␀␀ÀÍ(ÀÍ)ÀÍ€ŠÀÍ¯␀␀ÀÍÆÀÍÔ␀␀ÀÍÀÍ␀ÀÎE”-ÀÒYƒô/// A widget that calls callbacks in response to common pointer events.
